{"path":"memory/scoped_allocator_adaptor/inner_allocator","title":"std::scoped_allocator_adaptor<OuterAlloc,InnerAlloc...>::inner_allocator","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::scoped_allocator_adaptor&lt;OuterAlloc,InnerAlloc...&gt;::</span>inner_allocator","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/memory/scoped_allocator_adaptor/inner_allocator","section":"memory","kind":"page","summary":"Obtains a reference to the inner allocator used to declare this scoped_allocator_adaptor.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/scoped_allocator\">&lt;scoped_allocator&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">inner_allocator_type<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> inner_allocator<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> inner_allocator_type<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> inner_allocator<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Obtains a reference to the inner allocator used to declare this <code>scoped_allocator_adaptor</code>.\n</p><p>If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">sizeof...<span class=\"br0\">(</span>InnerAllocs<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span></span></code>, that is, no inner allocators were declared, returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>. Otherwise returns a reference to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/scoped_allocator_adaptor\"><span class=\"kw710\">std::<span class=\"me2\">scoped_allocator_adaptor</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>InnerAllocs...<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code>, that is, a scoped allocator composed of all inner allocators of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>, with the first inner allocator becoming the outer allocator.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>A reference to the inner allocator, which is itself a <code>std::scoped_allocator_adaptor</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/scoped_allocator_adaptor/outer_allocator\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>outer_allocator</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  obtains an <code>outer_allocator</code> reference <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"memory","title":"Memory management library"},{"path":"memory/scoped_allocator_adaptor","title":"std::scoped_allocator_adaptor"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::scoped_allocator_adaptor<OuterAlloc,InnerAlloc...>::inner_allocator","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++11. Obtains a reference to the inner allocator used to declare this scoped_allocator_adaptor."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"A reference to the inner allocator, which is itself a std::scoped_allocator_adaptor."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"outer_allocator","note":"obtains an outer_allocator reference"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":95,"codeBlockCount":0}
